1
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:43,520
Clear.

2
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:45,840
Left flank clear.

3
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,280
Cover!

4
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,480
Rockets!

5
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,360
Is everyone alright?

6
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,280
Spread out!

7
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:02,120
Deploy smoke grenades!

8
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,640
Squad Leader, hurry and send it!

9
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,120
We're running out of time!

10
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,800
The Blue Force command post isn't confirmed yet.

11
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,760
Send what?

12
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:48,600
Let's take out the Blue Force's combat forces first.

13
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:50,040
We can send it to the command post later.

14
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,640
I'll draft the message right now.

15
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:56,200
That's not right.

16
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:59,000
Their mission isn't a Decapitation Strike.

17
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,040
Then their mission is...

18
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:05,760
To provide an Incision Point for the Decapitation Strike.

19
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:10,040
This is the future direction of special ops units.

20
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,320
How could I have overlooked this?

21
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,640
Then just now,

22
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:14,280
we've already exposed many targets.

23
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:16,400
We can't let them send out the coordinates.

24
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:17,640
Staff Officer Zhu!

25
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:18,800
Yes, sir!

26
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,760
Initiate Full-spectrum Electronic Jamming immediately!

27
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:21,880
Turn the power to maximum!

28
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:23,960
Switch all internal comms to wired connections.

29
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:24,600
Yes, sir!

30
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,360
Activate the jamming system immediately!

31
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:47,480
Squad Leader, I can't hold on!

32
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:48,520
Almost done!

33
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,120
Report!

34
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:01,040
The island-wide jamming systems are activating.

35
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:10,120
Did it work?

36
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:17,720
Did it work?

37
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,280
We lost the signal.

38
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:25,560
Even if the jamming and transmission were simultaneous,

39
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:27,880
as long as Lin Yihu pressed the send button,

40
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:30,920
we can ensure the message was sent successfully.

41
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:33,880
We've tested it many times before.

42
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:34,640
Report!

43
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:35,520
Speak.

44
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,840
Message received from Morning Cloud Island.

45
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,080
A total of 12 targets.

46
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,360
Sender: Lin Yihu.

47
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:43,000
Execute the strike immediately.

48
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:43,640
Yes, sir.

49
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:21,840
Way to go, Lin Yihu.

50
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:35,720
That's great.

51
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,040
Lin Yihu,

52
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:39,160
you've finally turned the tables this round.

53
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:58,840
Squad Leader!

54
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:01,160
Squad Leader, we succeeded! Squad Leader!

55
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:03,200
Squad Leader, look, we succeeded.

56
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:04,920
We succeeded, Squad Leader.

57
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:07,840
Squad Leader Wu, I succeeded.

58
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,160
I didn't...

59
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:13,280
I didn't let him down.

60
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:16,280
I didn't let him down.

61
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,240
Huzi!

62
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:23,440
I saw it.

63
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:26,760
You succeeded.

64
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,480
You did it.

65
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:37,160
Squad Leader Wu.

66
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:39,600
Did you see that?

67
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:40,960
We succeeded.

68
00:10:41,520 --> 00:10:43,240
I didn't let you down.

69
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:49,000
Understood.

70
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,400
Everyone, pull back to the command post.

71
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:53,480
Everyone, fall back now.

72
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:58,200
Don't get so worked up.

73
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:01,560
Guo Zijian has the New-type Combat System.

74
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:02,600
On this point,

75
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:04,480
we can't compare to him.

76
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:07,280
He can Command the wind and rain now.

77
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,760
With the battle at this point,

78
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:12,000
firepower and missiles are useless.

79
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:13,640
Staff Officer Zhu!

80
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,040
Yes, sir!

81
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:15,600
Order the surveillance squad

82
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,640
to closely monitor all cameras in the command post.

83
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:19,960
I want to see

84
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:21,160
how Guo Zijian

85
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:23,240
infiltrates my heart and brain.

86
00:11:23,760 --> 00:11:24,240
Yes, sir!

87
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:28,560
Let's see what this kid is really capable of.

88
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:32,640
Report!

89
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:33,080
Speak.

90
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:35,360
We still can't contact anyone on the frontline.

91
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:38,960
It seems they've set up on the island

92
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:40,920
high-power information jamming equipment.

93
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,600
That means we've been forcibly stripped

94
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:45,360
of contact with the frontline special ops.

95
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:46,480
Alright.

96
00:11:48,760 --> 00:11:50,520
Since we can't make contact,

97
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:52,200
we might as well

98
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,960
all stay in the dark together.

99
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:55,600
What do you mean?

100
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,360
It's their home turf now.

101
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,040
Guo Zijian is short on manpower,

102
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,480
he can't make contact,

103
00:12:00,920 --> 00:12:01,720
and is on the defensive at every turn.

104
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,400
So we might as well

105
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,400
destroy all the power equipment

106
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:06,280
on the entire island,

107
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:09,000
so Long Yuanshan won't have an advantage either.

108
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:12,120
You want to use a Graphite bomb?

109
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:14,680
Order:

110
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:17,200
Immediately access the top-tier combat system

111
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:19,360
and request the use of a Graphite bomb.

112
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:20,520
Yes, sir!

113
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:37,880
Beihua,

114
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:39,120
did you see that?

115
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:42,480
The Wind Rider Battalion is requesting a Graphite bomb.

116
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,400
In our exercises,

117
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:47,080
we've rarely used tactics like this.

118
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:48,520
It's just too powerful.

119
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:51,120
Young guys these days will try anything.

120
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:53,080
I'll support it as long as it helps us win.

121
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:54,600
My only regret is

122
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:56,080
that the power grid on this island

123
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:57,840
is too small.

124
00:12:58,520 --> 00:13:00,240
What a waste of my perfectly good Graphite bomb.

125
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:03,360
Old Zhang, did you see that?

126
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:06,520
Beihua has even learned to be thrifty now.

127
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,920
Activate backup power immediately.

128
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,200
Yes, sir. Activating now.

129
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,880
Report! Backup power has been destroyed.

130
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:25,880
It cannot be activated.

131
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:28,520
The circuits are destroyed. It's a Graphite bomb.

132
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,080
Comrades.

133
00:13:38,640 --> 00:13:39,480
It is obvious

134
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,960
that the Red Army used a Graphite bomb.

135
00:13:42,400 --> 00:13:43,400
But even so,

136
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:46,000
there are only a few dozen Red Army soldiers on the island.

137
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:48,360
And after our multiple strikes,

138
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:49,880
there are barely any left.

139
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,800
Our special ops team is more than enough to handle them.

140
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:54,520
Now, I order

141
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:57,240
all personnel to prepare for combat.

142
00:13:57,680 --> 00:13:58,360
Yes, sir.

143
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,040
To be reborn from desperation.

144
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:03,600
That was a ruthless move by Guo Zijian.

145
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:05,120
How many men are left in the special ops team?

146
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,160
They've been in constant crossfire.

147
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:08,480
Let me get a count.

148
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:09,720
Notify the troops immediately.

149
00:14:10,880 --> 00:14:11,960
Hold your positions and stand by.

150
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:13,640
Do not engage proactively.

151
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:15,960
Judging by the effect of their mobile warfare,

152
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,120
their personnel are highly capable.

153
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,160
The fewer their numbers,

154
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:19,320
the easier it is for them to operate.

155
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:21,160
We can't let them gain an advantage.

156
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:22,240
Yes, sir.

157
00:14:28,160 --> 00:14:29,280
Jiang Shengqiang did a beautiful job.

158
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:33,240
Honey Badger, Siberian Tiger.

159
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:35,640
Report your current personnel status.

160
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:36,800
Report!

161
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:39,600
Honey Badger team currently has five combatants.

162
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:40,880
Report!

163
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:43,400
Siberian Tiger team currently has four combatants.

164
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:44,400
Copy that.

165
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:45,800
I assess

166
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:47,600
that the Blue Army command post

167
00:14:47,880 --> 00:14:49,520
is located in Building 13, southwest corner.

168
00:14:50,160 --> 00:14:51,960
Choose your approach routes carefully,

169
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:53,480
and advance stealthily.

170
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:54,280
Understood.

171
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,200
Honey Badger copies.

172
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:57,040
Move out.

173
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:02,920
Do you three know

174
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:04,920
why you are the key protection targets

175
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:06,040
of our squad?

176
00:15:06,520 --> 00:15:07,120
The drones.

177
00:15:07,400 --> 00:15:08,040
Exactly.

178
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:09,920
Your mission now

179
00:15:10,560 --> 00:15:12,320
is to return to the drone hideout.

180
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:13,840
When the time is right,

181
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:15,480
launch the drone swarm

182
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,600
to execute the final strike on the Blue Army.

183
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:18,280
Understood.

184
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:20,400
Zhao Xiaoyun, Ma Zhengzheng.

185
00:15:20,640 --> 00:15:21,080
Here!

186
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:22,760
Your core mission

187
00:15:22,840 --> 00:15:24,480
is to keep Dongfang safe.

188
00:15:24,920 --> 00:15:25,400
Understood?

189
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:26,120
Understood.

190
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:27,200
Move out.

191
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,280
Reporting, Sirs.

192
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:44,240
Due to their ultimate move with the Graphite bomb,

193
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:46,200
which we truly didn't anticipate,

194
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:49,560
Exercise Control cannot provide real-time video.

195
00:15:49,760 --> 00:15:51,920
We've coordinated with the Navy for support.

196
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:54,600
They will dispatch a small communication ship,

197
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:55,800
equipped with a base station,

198
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:58,640
to ensure uninterrupted wireless communication.

199
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:04,040
It's been confirmed.

200
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:07,000
The Red Army currently has only three teams.

201
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:08,480
Each team has four or five men.

202
00:16:08,920 --> 00:16:10,400
Don't underestimate these three teams.

203
00:16:10,640 --> 00:16:11,760
Especially that Yang Maolin.

204
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:12,760
I know.

205
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:14,440
I've fought him before.

206
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:15,480
He's got some skills.

207
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:16,440
But it doesn't matter.

208
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:17,400
In modern warfare,

209
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:18,800
a single bullet will still kill him.

210
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,440
Actually, with just those few men of his,

211
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:21,760
even if we lined up at the command post,

212
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:22,720
he still couldn't break in.

213
00:16:23,920 --> 00:16:24,720
What's the situation now?

214
00:16:25,640 --> 00:16:26,680
Right now, except for our second floor,

215
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:27,840
every other floor

216
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:28,880
has men stationed.

217
00:16:29,560 --> 00:16:30,240
Good.

218
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:33,840
Then let's wait for him to walk right into the trap.

219
00:17:32,600 --> 00:17:34,520
Report. Everything is ready on our end.

220
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:39,560
It's not time yet.

221
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:41,760
Do not launch a strike prematurely.

222
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:42,720
Still not attacking?

223
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:44,400
Wait any longer and you'll all be KIA.

224
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:45,040
It'll be too late.

225
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:46,600
Await my command.

226
00:17:47,360 --> 00:17:48,480
Your current mission

227
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:51,280
is to monitor the second floor from all angles

228
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:52,920
and wait for my hand signals.

229
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:56,880
I don't see you on the second floor.

230
00:17:58,360 --> 00:17:59,600
You will in a moment.

231
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:01,200
Copy that.

232
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:05,240
Honey Badger.

233
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:07,160
Honey Badger, copy.

234
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:08,600
I'll go turn myself in first.

235
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:10,360
I'll be right behind to protect you.

236
00:19:28,520 --> 00:19:29,680
Brigadier Long.

237
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:31,760
Look who's here.

238
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:35,280
Guo Zijian.

239
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:40,840
Shouldn't you be at the command post?

240
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,240
What brings you here?

241
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:46,600
Leading men onto the island yourself.

242
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:49,560
Don't tell me you're plotting another trick.

243
00:19:51,120 --> 00:19:52,280
You've already captured me.

244
00:19:52,840 --> 00:19:53,880
What tricks could I possibly have?

245
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:57,280
One Graphite bomb,

246
00:19:58,120 --> 00:19:59,720
and you really think you've won?

247
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:02,360
Your naivety is quite adorable, Little Guo.

248
00:20:02,520 --> 00:20:03,200
You know that, right?

249
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:06,280
If my calculations are correct,

250
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:08,200
you only have Yang Maolin left,

251
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:10,040
holding out with three rookies.

252
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:11,400
But...

253
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:13,200
our battalion command post is still active.

254
00:20:13,800 --> 00:20:15,000
My detachment is still here.

255
00:20:16,080 --> 00:20:16,600
True.

256
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:20,640
But even if your Amphibious Infantry Fighting Vehicle lands,

257
00:20:21,520 --> 00:20:22,880
it won't solve your pressing need.

258
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:25,400
Not to mention, my Ultra-long-range Strike Force

259
00:20:25,400 --> 00:20:27,200
has already targeted the perimeter of Morning Cloud Island.

260
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:30,840
None of your forces have a chance to enter anymore.

261
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:32,400
So,

262
00:20:33,240 --> 00:20:34,520
Brigadier Long has definitely won this round.

263
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:37,240
Do you still think you can turn the tables?

264
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:49,520
Guo Zijian.

265
00:20:50,560 --> 00:20:52,320
You don't even have a trump card left.

266
00:20:53,520 --> 00:20:54,360
I actually thought

267
00:20:54,360 --> 00:20:56,200
we'd have a fierce showdown.

268
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:58,520
Too bad you didn't make it to the end.

269
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:01,480
You have no combat power left.

270
00:21:02,240 --> 00:21:02,880
In short,

271
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:05,680
the battle is over.

272
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:16,000
Now it's our turn.

273
00:22:25,800 --> 00:22:27,000
This scenario

274
00:22:27,520 --> 00:22:29,240
took a turn way too fast.

275
00:22:31,400 --> 00:22:33,160
Different equipment, different tactics,

276
00:22:33,320 --> 00:22:34,680
and even different generations of weapons

277
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:37,360
can replace and cancel each other out.

278
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:39,320
But only the human element

279
00:22:39,680 --> 00:22:41,800
in this showdown of brand-new equipment

280
00:22:42,480 --> 00:22:44,640
leaves us with endless food for thought.

281
00:22:58,680 --> 00:22:59,240
I announce

282
00:23:00,040 --> 00:23:01,200
that this exercise

283
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:02,920
is now concluded.

284
00:23:03,560 --> 00:23:06,840
The 396th Brigade and the Wind Rider Battalion are victorious.

285
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:36,840
Staff Officer Liang, did you see that?

286
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:39,200
