575
00:37:41,640 --> 00:37:43,160
Let's go. I'll see you off.

576
00:38:23,640 --> 00:38:24,680
It's almost time.

577
00:38:24,760 --> 00:38:26,040
Let's just say goodbye here.

578
00:38:57,480 --> 00:38:57,960
Guo Zijian

579
00:38:59,320 --> 00:39:00,840
Although we're on different paths now,

580
00:39:02,480 --> 00:39:03,840
our destination is the same.

581
00:39:05,400 --> 00:39:06,680
I believe it won't be long

582
00:39:07,720 --> 00:39:09,600
before you meet a better version of me.

583
00:39:14,040 --> 00:39:15,240
I look forward to our reunion,

584
00:39:17,000 --> 00:39:18,920
and to better versions of ourselves.

585
00:39:20,080 --> 00:39:20,840
Liang Hong

586
00:39:22,600 --> 00:39:23,480
I'll wait for you.

587
00:40:53,240 --> 00:40:54,440
The global landscape is ever-changing.

588
00:40:55,640 --> 00:40:56,200
Deputy Battalion Commander,

589
00:40:58,760 --> 00:40:59,960
the exercise is about to begin.

590
00:41:00,680 --> 00:41:02,160
Notify all personnel of the Wind Rider Battalion.

591
00:41:02,920 --> 00:41:03,280
Move out!

592
00:41:03,600 --> 00:41:04,080
Yes, sir!

593
00:41:12,560 --> 00:41:12,960
Orders!

594
00:41:13,320 --> 00:41:14,320
First and Second Companies,

595
00:41:14,800 --> 00:41:16,320
flank the north side of Kaizhou Mountain.

596
00:41:16,760 --> 00:41:17,560
Launch the drones.

597
00:41:18,240 --> 00:41:19,160
Target the Jiahe Valley area

598
00:41:19,160 --> 00:41:20,160
and conduct reconnaissance by fire.

599
00:41:21,880 --> 00:41:22,360
Execute!

600
00:41:22,760 --> 00:41:23,200
Yes, sir!

601
00:41:54,200 --> 00:41:54,600
Report.

602
00:41:55,160 --> 00:41:57,800
The comrade from the Army Combat Research Center is here.

603
00:42:03,640 --> 00:42:04,720
Staff Major Liang Hong,

604
00:42:04,800 --> 00:42:07,480
ordered to assist the 396th Brigade in this exercise.

605
00:42:20,640 --> 00:42:22,360
Conflicts persist across the globe.

606
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:24,280
The flames of war have never died out.

607
00:42:25,360 --> 00:42:26,600
We love peace,

608
00:42:27,480 --> 00:42:29,880
but we will never tolerate any provocation.

609
00:42:31,040 --> 00:42:33,640
Behind every citizen is a powerful motherland.

610
00:42:34,000 --> 00:42:35,280
And behind our powerful motherland

611
00:42:35,800 --> 00:42:37,960
is an ever-strengthening Chinese military.

612
00:42:38,960 --> 00:42:41,480
We are an invincible force,

613
00:42:42,840 --> 00:42:43,640
always forging ahead

614
00:42:44,040 --> 00:42:45,880
to defend the peace of our motherland and our people.
